<title>UK: Aluminium output unchanged in September - IPAI.</title>
<headline>Aluminium output unchanged in September - IPAI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>September daily average primary aluminium output was unchanged at 50,800 tonnes from August, provisional figures from the International Primary Aluminium Institute (IPAI) showed on Monday.</p>
<p>This compares with 48,200 tonnes in September 1995.</p>
<p>Total production in September (30 days) was 1.525 million tonnes, compared with 1.574 million in August (31 days) and 1.446 million in September 1995.  </p>
<p>The regional breakdown of primary aluminium production was as follows (in thousands of tonnes) the IPAI said.</p>
<p>				Sep 96   Aug 96   Sep 95</p>
<p>    Africa		    89	 92	 54</p>
<p>    North America	  479	496	465</p>
<p>    Latin America	  172	178	172</p>
<p>    East/South Asia	130	135	135</p>
<p>    Europe West	    261	269	n/a</p>
<p>    Europe East/Central  255	262	n/a</p>
<p>    Oceania		  139	142	130</p>
</text>
